A marker at an enclosing item's content column folds into a quote below it

```
- a
  > - x
  - m
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <blockquote>
      <ul>
        <li>x
- m</li>
      </ul>
    </blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- > - x
  - m
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote>
      <ul>
        <li>x
- m</li>
      </ul>
    </blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

